<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil again omits payout.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said Monday its net proceeds for the month of September totaled $206,142 or $0.01376 per unit, decreasing the cost carry-forward to $2,792,548.</p>
<p>Accordingly, there will be no distribution for September 1996. The trust's last payout was in October 1995.</p>
<p>In addition, net current month Trust administrative expenses of $8,053 will be paid from the Trust administrative expense reserve resulting in about $2.0 million remaining in the expense reserve. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
